    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Hachaliah Bailey once built a massive home here called Bailey's Mansion, which was reputed to contain one hundred rooms.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28,
        29
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bailey's_Crossroads%2C_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "On November 20, 1861, over 50,000 Union troops massed at Bailey's Crossroads for a military review attended by Abraham Lincoln.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
