      ],
      "source": "https://baileyscrossroadsneighborhood.org/bailey-s-crossroads-where-history-and-heritage-shape-the-heart-of-a-northern-virginia-neighborhood/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Skyline Center, a towering group of apartment buildings and offices built in the 1970s, is the most noticeable landmark in the area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
